\section{Conclusion}
This chapter presents the full CTS solver architecture used by UKG-SE v2.0. The 
pipeline integrates conformal geometry, elliptic solvers, constraint stabilization, 
and residual correction to generate consistent initial data for evolving spacetimes, 
including high-spin Kerr geometries.